# Petasos Core

- English only for code, docs, UI copy, commits, and PR text.
- No inline comments. Prefer clear names and small modules.
- Keep files focused; split stores, services, and UI by feature.
- UI components use kebab-case filenames and stock shadcn primitives.
- Never hand-edit `src/components/ui/*`; use `npx shadcn@latest add`.
  Theme tokens only in `src/index.css`. Custom widgets stay outside `ui/`.
- Remote I/O goes through `homelab-gateway` only; never call Hermes, Glances, or Codex exporters directly from the client.
- Chat uses conversations + SSE (`model_id`, optional `reasoning_effort`). Never send raw `provider` / `model` / `model_options`.
- Never put secrets in `VITE_*` env vars. Use `GATEWAY_API_KEY` at runtime (Vite proxy or Tauri).
- GazeHero is a companion. Do not wire it to navigation; only gaze state.
- Update `README.md` and `docs/` when behavior or setup changes.
- Update `.cursor/rules/` when conventions change.
- Do not commit secrets, `.env`, or `sandbox/sandbox-data/`.
- Prefer iterative commits with a clear why over large mixed dumps.
